@@ -0,0 +1,583 @@
+/*
+ * Bounded, opt-in GPU request accounting. The method/value accounting and
+ * per-batch observer are adapted from bloodwake-recomp's
+ * src/gpu/bw_gpu_audit.c, commit e631edddfe56d22344e9f696923aeb6d78a9e7ba.
+ *
